(5771582, 840263, 49788, '<td valign="top">Great sky, good colors in the building, and interesting shape in the tree. I like it. I think the image could be improved if you cropped it more tightly, e.g., got rid of some of the foreground, which isn''t very interesting.</td>', 'Great sky, good colors in the building, and interesting shape in the tree. I like it. I think the image could be improved if you cropped it more tightly, e.g., got rid of some of the foreground, which isn''t very interesting.', '2009-12-18 16:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5771585, 840416, 49788, '<td valign="top">Perfect subject for this challenge. I love the blue and red in the tractor contrasting with the green. My one criticism would be the lighting, which seems a bit flat to me.</td>', 'Perfect subject for this challenge. I love the blue and red in the tractor contrasting with the green. My one criticism would be the lighting, which seems a bit flat to me.', '2009-12-18 16:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
