(5771594, 840378, 83686, '<td valign="top">Try using the full image allowance to give the viewer a better look at your shot. This image doesn''t really convey the thought, "Rural", to me.</td>', 'Try using the full image allowance to give the viewer a better look at your shot. This image doesn''t really convey the thought, "Rural", to me.', '2009-12-18 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
