(5771616, 840265, 83686, '<td valign="top">Too much white. I know there is snow but taken at a different time of the day this would look much better IMO.</td>', 'Too much white. I know there is snow but taken at a different time of the day this would look much better IMO.', '2009-12-18 17:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
