(5771661, 840297, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not getting much of a sense of decay from this one.  Might have been better for this challenge to show some rust, and maybe crop out that nicely maintained field on the right.</td>', 'Not getting much of a sense of decay from this one.  Might have been better for this challenge to show some rust, and maybe crop out that nicely maintained field on the right.', '2009-12-18 17:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
