(5771665, 839868, 65234, '<td valign="top">Tree has a nice shape but doesn''t look particularly decayed to me.  There is something hanging from it which could be decayed but I can''t tell what it is.</td>', 'Tree has a nice shape but doesn''t look particularly decayed to me.  There is something hanging from it which could be decayed but I can''t tell what it is.', '2009-12-18 17:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5771666, 840366, 65234, '<td valign="top">Dirt looks really rich thereabouts.  Vehicle is a decent subject but I might prefer a less straight-on perspective to add some interest.</td>', 'Dirt looks really rich thereabouts.  Vehicle is a decent subject but I might prefer a less straight-on perspective to add some interest.', '2009-12-18 17:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
