(5771673, 840308, 65234, '<td valign="top">Snowy, but looks to still have nice tread on the tires.  A closer view of its rustier bits might have better grabbed my attention.</td>', 'Snowy, but looks to still have nice tread on the tires.  A closer view of its rustier bits might have better grabbed my attention.', '2009-12-18 18:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
