(5771755, 839975, 52336, '<td valign="top">Very appealing, though I would have liked to see the framing include the entire car, right down to the tiny portion that''s currently cropped. 7</td>', 'Very appealing, though I would have liked to see the framing include the entire car, right down to the tiny portion that''s currently cropped. 7', '2009-12-18 19:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
