(5778383, 840261, 32011, '<td valign="top">One of my favourite images in this challenge.  I gave it an 8 during my voting pass, but now bumping it to a 9 during my comment pass.  I love the minimalism and the Christmas connection you''ve captured.  My only wish... that more DPCers took photos like this.  Well done.</td>', 'One of my favourite images in this challenge.  I gave it an 8 during my voting pass, but now bumping it to a 9 during my comment pass.  I love the minimalism and the Christmas connection you''ve captured.  My only wish... that more DPCers took photos like this.  Well done.', '2009-12-22 22:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778385, 840431, 32011, '<td valign="top">I quite like this... guess I''m a bit of a sucker for duotones and vignettes.  Good detail.  Well composed and interesting subject... all point to this doing fairly well with the wider DPC community.  Good luck.</td>', 'I quite like this... guess I''m a bit of a sucker for duotones and vignettes.  Good detail.  Well composed and interesting subject... all point to this doing fairly well with the wider DPC community.  Good luck.', '2009-12-22 22:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778387, 839868, 32011, '<td valign="top">One of my favourite images in the challenge.  I''m a bit of a sucker for dead trees and strangely coloured skies... one first pass I gave this an 8, but upon reflection I feel it deserves a little more, so will nudge it to a 9.  Good luck.</td>', 'One of my favourite images in the challenge.  I''m a bit of a sucker for dead trees and strangely coloured skies... one first pass I gave this an 8, but upon reflection I feel it deserves a little more, so will nudge it to a 9.  Good luck.', '2009-12-22 22:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778398, 839916, 32011, '<td valign="top">An excellent image for this challenge.  Processed perfectly.  Composition and detail are fantastic... this should get a ribbon.  Originally gave it a 7 (think it was only of the early votes and I hadn''t established the baseline for the challenge at the time), but clearly deserves a bump... to an 8.. perhaps for now... but I might be back after commenting on some more to bump it further.</td>', 'An excellent image for this challenge.  Processed perfectly.  Composition and detail are fantastic... this should get a ribbon.  Originally gave it a 7 (think it was only of the early votes and I hadn''t established the baseline for the challenge at the time), but clearly deserves a bump... to an 8.. perhaps for now... but I might be back after commenting on some more to bump it further.', '2009-12-22 22:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778405, 840082, 32011, '<td valign="top">Yet another image I was much too harsh on when doing my first pass voting.  This is a wonderful image.  Well composed... great detail... just wonderful all over.  Reminds me of the Victorian high country after last summers fires... actually wouldn''t be surprised if it actually is a photo from up there... anyway... initially gave it a 7, but now think it deserves a 9.  Well done with a great image.</td>', 'Yet another image I was much too harsh on when doing my first pass voting.  This is a wonderful image.  Well composed... great detail... just wonderful all over.  Reminds me of the Victorian high country after last summers fires... actually wouldn''t be surprised if it actually is a photo from up there... anyway... initially gave it a 7, but now think it deserves a 9.  Well done with a great image.', '2009-12-22 22:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778408, 839397, 32011, '<td valign="top">Great image.  Love the mountains and the clouds... the building is too centred for my liking though.  Would have given in an extra one or two if not for that I reckon... none the less... still one of the higher scoring photos from my voting contribution for this challenge.</td>', 'Great image.  Love the mountains and the clouds... the building is too centred for my liking though.  Would have given in an extra one or two if not for that I reckon... none the less... still one of the higher scoring photos from my voting contribution for this challenge.', '2009-12-22 22:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778416, 840409, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo, showing the rural decay from the inside out (whereas most others chose to show it the other way).  Excellent use of B&amp;W.  Composition and detail are good... and I love the story this image seems to be telling.  Only gave it a 6 in my gut-feel first pass voting pass, but clearly, looking at it now, it''s deserving of much more... an 8 is more fitting I feel.  Hope it does well... it''s one of the best images in the challenge.  Well done.</td>', 'This is a great photo, showing the rural decay from the inside out (whereas most others chose to show it the other way).  Excellent use of B&W.  Composition and detail are good... and I love the story this image seems to be telling.  Only gave it a 6 in my gut-feel first pass voting pass, but clearly, looking at it now, it''s deserving of much more... an 8 is more fitting I feel.  Hope it does well... it''s one of the best images in the challenge.  Well done.', '2009-12-22 22:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778894, 840033, 102109, '<td valign="top">PS edge accent filter is too obvious - looks solarised, but perhaps this is your intention?</td>', 'PS edge accent filter is too obvious - looks solarised, but perhaps this is your intention?', '2009-12-23 04:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778895, 840318, 102109, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed! Looks like a darkroom print on fibre paper.</td>', 'Very nice indeed! Looks like a darkroom print on fibre paper.', '2009-12-23 04:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
