(5779183, 839586, 35804, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the challenge. An image pleasing to look at, but also makes the viewer think...hopefully...very nice.</td>', 'One of my favorites of the challenge. An image pleasing to look at, but also makes the viewer think...hopefully...very nice.', '2009-12-23 10:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5779187, 840261, 35804, '<td valign="top">There are no words for just how much I love this...sad yet funny...just really excellent on so many levels.</td>', 'There are no words for just how much I love this...sad yet funny...just really excellent on so many levels.', '2009-12-23 10:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5779194, 840289, 63244, '<td valign="top">For some reason, IMO, the overly bright colors and the over the top processing done''t add to this particular photograph. Sorry. The photo itself is nice as the building has it''s own charm, but you lose some of the subtlties (sp) and the texture with the dark processing. Perhaps leave it a bit "less" and still bring out the textures? There is a great fence in the shot and what looks like it was a water pump (left of the house), but it''s too dark to see what it is.<br/>Maybe it''s my monitor. There is potential, but for my taste, it''s a bit extreme. :) Edited for bad spelling, omg! Sorry!</td>', 'For some reason, IMO, the overly bright colors and the over the top processing done''t add to this particular photograph. Sorry. The photo itself is nice as the building has it''s own charm, but you lose some of the subtlties (sp) and the texture with the dark processing. Perhaps leave it a bit "less" and still bring out the textures? There is a great fence in the shot and what looks like it was a water pump (left of the house), but it''s too dark to see what it is.Maybe it''s my monitor. There is potential, but for my taste, it''s a bit extreme. :) Edited for bad spelling, omg! Sorry!', '2009-12-23 11:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
