(5780677, 839586, 67697, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t convey decay to me too much.  These items just seem out of context and I''m not getting the whole picture.  But I''m still giving it a 7 because I love the light, shadows, and the dof.</td>', 'This doesn''t convey decay to me too much.  These items just seem out of context and I''m not getting the whole picture.  But I''m still giving it a 7 because I love the light, shadows, and the dof.', '2009-12-24 21:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780679, 840261, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m gonna take a wild guess and say this is a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=53814" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">pointandshoot</a> photo.  I guess this is kind of decay of the natural kind, but it doesn''t scream "meets the challenge!" to me.  HOWEVER, I love it.  The cat reaching in to grab the ornament, the way all cats do, is just cracking me up.  Fun and creative.</td>', 'I''m gonna take a wild guess and say this is a  pointandshoot photo.  I guess this is kind of decay of the natural kind, but it doesn''t scream "meets the challenge!" to me.  HOWEVER, I love it.  The cat reaching in to grab the ornament, the way all cats do, is just cracking me up.  Fun and creative.', '2009-12-24 21:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
