(5780701, 839915, 67697, '<td valign="top">Love the capture of the moving sky and it''s reflection.  The darkness tho kind of takes away from how old this fence might be.  I do think it is interesting that the fence seems to be dividing the body of water.</td>', 'Love the capture of the moving sky and it''s reflection.  The darkness tho kind of takes away from how old this fence might be.  I do think it is interesting that the fence seems to be dividing the body of water.', '2009-12-24 22:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
