(5780721, 840289, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is a little too smoothed out - was it noisy?  There seems to be more emphasis placed on the sky instead of the building, which is tucked into the corner of the photo.  That must have been some sky to see tho - it''s beautiful!</td>', 'This is a little too smoothed out - was it noisy?  There seems to be more emphasis placed on the sky instead of the building, which is tucked into the corner of the photo.  That must have been some sky to see tho - it''s beautiful!', '2009-12-24 23:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
