(5780748, 840325, 83313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kaiser_chief:</b></div><hr/><i> An out of the Box image that struggles to meet the challenge and does not appeal visually..........Ice on the head does not add anything, elements in the background are distracting and the lighting too uneven to make this image work </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I find this comment to be quite interesting, as everything he does not like about this is what I found appealing about it. (Got a 9 from me, BTW.) That''s what opinions are like, though, right? We all have one and when they converge, we get ribbons.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-12-25 00:22:06.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by kaiser_chief: An out of the Box image that struggles to meet the challenge and does not appeal visually..........Ice on the head does not add anything, elements in the background are distracting and the lighting too uneven to make this image work  I find this comment to be quite interesting, as everything he does not like about this is what I found appealing about it. (Got a 9 from me, BTW.) That''s what opinions are like, though, right? We all have one and when they converge, we get ribbons.', '2009-12-25 00:21:36.000000', '2009-12-25 00:22:06.000000', 0),
