(5780787, 840435, 69046, '<td valign="top">Crazy ass trailer, love it!</td>', 'Crazy ass trailer, love it!', '2009-12-25 01:39:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5780788, 840435, 61084, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> A good strong effort. I think some jagginess and blown highlights, especially in the background, may be what let it down a bit. It got a 7 from me, I like what you did achieve with this entry and it conveys a sense of decay and abandonment very well. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for a very good vote Steve, and I agree with everything you said. The jaggies in the trees were very troublesome to me, but in the end there was nothing I could do about them. I normally don''t shoot other peoples property so I was a bit nervous that someone would say something. I ended up taking about 12 shots total and wasn''t happy with any of them in the series. I truly expected this entry to do worse than it did so ending up at 5.4+ was a nice surprise. My hope was that the subject matter and processing would carry it despite the imperfections and to that end I think it probably did.<br/> <br/>It did well enough to take over 4th place on my profile page so I am thankful for the votes that got it that far. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: A good strong effort. I think some jagginess and blown highlights, especially in the background, may be what let it down a bit. It got a 7 from me, I like what you did achieve with this entry and it conveys a sense of decay and abandonment very well.   Thanks for a very good vote Steve, and I agree with everything you said. The jaggies in the trees were very troublesome to me, but in the end there was nothing I could do about them. I normally don''t shoot other peoples property so I was a bit nervous that someone would say something. I ended up taking about 12 shots total and wasn''t happy with any of them in the series. I truly expected this entry to do worse than it did so ending up at 5.4+ was a nice surprise. My hope was that the subject matter and processing would carry it despite the imperfections and to that end I think it probably did. It did well enough to take over 4th place on my profile page so I am thankful for the votes that got it that far. :)', '2009-12-25 01:40:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5780791, 839461, 69046, '<td valign="top">Goregeous tones, way underscoered. I can''t understand why this is 62nd. Makes no sense. 5.2?   B.S.!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Goregeous tones, way underscoered. I can''t understand why this is 62nd. Makes no sense. 5.2?   B.S.! ', '2009-12-25 01:43:49.000000', NULL, 0),
