(5780804, 839456, 18197, '<td valign="top">I think this is very well done. The car with the bullet hole in the windshield adds to what would have been just-another-train. The blue color a nice complement to the train. I even like the grain which gives it a distressed look..</td>', 'I think this is very well done. The car with the bullet hole in the windshield adds to what would have been just-another-train. The blue color a nice complement to the train. I even like the grain which gives it a distressed look..', '2009-12-25 02:18:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5780828, 840429, 61084, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your blue. Just curious though...are you running out of things to shoot in Philly? LOL. I KNEW I''d seen this somewhere before. :)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=840429" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1140/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_840429.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1140/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_840429.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1140/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_840429.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=792360" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1038/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_792360.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1038/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_792360.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1038/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_792360.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-12-25 03:00:49.</i></td>', 'Congrats on your blue. Just curious though...are you running out of things to shoot in Philly? LOL. I KNEW I''d seen this somewhere before. :)  ', '2009-12-25 03:00:25.000000', '2009-12-25 03:00:49.000000', 0),
