(5780893, 840297, 58615, '<td valign="top">Underrated for sure. This was a 9 for me. Its a great scene created here. I really like the tree so if there was one criticism it would be to maybe try and show more of it rather than having it slightly covered by the truck. Fantastic image and the black and white (and noise?) really makes it.</td>', 'Underrated for sure. This was a 9 for me. Its a great scene created here. I really like the tree so if there was one criticism it would be to maybe try and show more of it rather than having it slightly covered by the truck. Fantastic image and the black and white (and noise?) really makes it.', '2009-12-25 08:59:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5780899, 840406, 75034, '<td valign="top">Way to go Susan, I told you you would climb up to the top soon and it looks like I was right.<br/> <br/>Great capture and processing. I like the perspective of the shot and the framing of the trees around the old house makes it even better.<br/> <br/>It looks great on your front page.<br/> <br/>Hope to get out with you again soon. I love to winter shoot.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Way to go Susan, I told you you would climb up to the top soon and it looks like I was right. Great capture and processing. I like the perspective of the shot and the framing of the trees around the old house makes it even better. It looks great on your front page. Hope to get out with you again soon. I love to winter shoot. All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-12-25 09:19:37.000000', NULL, 0),
