(5781148, 839805, 66384, '<td valign="top">Really nice, Jeb. I like the little glimpse of the pew inside the church, and the plants that are growing inside as well as outside. So many levels here with the reflections. Really nice processing too. Congrats on the top ten placement.</td>', 'Really nice, Jeb. I like the little glimpse of the pew inside the church, and the plants that are growing inside as well as outside. So many levels here with the reflections. Really nice processing too. Congrats on the top ten placement.', '2009-12-25 18:19:53.000000', NULL, 0),
