(5781552, 839397, 30982, '<td valign="top">I was gonna say this doesn''t look a lot like Texas...  :-)  LOVELY shot and gorgeous edit - congrats on the excellent score and the shiny ribbon!  (As for "dropping" the door and window, I don''t think I really would have noticed if you hadn''t mentioned it.)</td>', 'I was gonna say this doesn''t look a lot like Texas...  :-)  LOVELY shot and gorgeous edit - congrats on the excellent score and the shiny ribbon!  (As for "dropping" the door and window, I don''t think I really would have noticed if you hadn''t mentioned it.)', '2009-12-26 12:09:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5781915, 839975, 42013, '<td valign="top">The full spectrum of colors are represented on this old lady. Congrats on top 10!</td>', 'The full spectrum of colors are represented on this old lady. Congrats on top 10!', '2009-12-26 20:23:41.000000', NULL, 0),
